4:T466,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is 25 minutes (Pomodoro) the best focus time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The 25/5 Pomodoro method is great for beginners and for highly repetitive tasks. However, for deep cognitive work like coding, writing, or studying complex math, a 50/10 or 90/20 Ultradian sprint allows your brain to enter a state of deep flow."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long should a deep work sprint be?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A deep work sprint should typically be 50 to 90 minutes. Neurobiology shows that the human brain operates on 90-minute Ultradian rhythms. After 90 minutes of intense focus, a 20-30 minute active rest period is required to consolidate learning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I do during a Pomodoro break?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"True rest requires disconnecting from high-dopamine activities. Step away from your desk, stretch, drink water, or stare at something in the distance. Do not check social media, read emails, or watch short-form videos."}}]}7:T668,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","@id":"https://planbotai.app/#organization","name":"PlannextTech","alternateName":"PlanBot Team","url":"https://planbotai.app","areaServed":{"@type":"Country","name":"Worldwide"},"logo":"https://planbotai.app/android-chrome-512x512.png","description":"PlannextTech builds advanced AI productivity tools and scheduling systems for ambitious individuals. PlanBot is our flagship AI daily planner app for Android, designed to optimize time management and routine generation.","founder":{"@type":"Person","name":"Naitik Baldaniya","jobTitle":"Founder & CEO","url":"https://planbotai.app/about","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/naitik-baldaniya-b0079234a","https://www.instagram.com/planbotai?igsh=bXplYm92dG13c3Jq","https://x.com/planbotai"],"description":"Productivity systems architect and software d